.TH AURAPASS 1 "2026" "aurapass 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aurapass \- command-line interface to AuraPass vaults
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aurapass
.RI [ options ]
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aurapass
reads and writes AuraPass vaults: single files protected with Argon2id and
XChaCha20-Poly1305. Every command works on a vault file, so the tool is safe to
use in scripts and on headless machines.
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-vault " " \fIFILE\fR
Vault file to operate on. Falls back to
.BR $AURAPASS_VAULT ,
then to the most recently used vault.
.TP
.BR \-\-password-file " " \fIFILE\fR
Read the master password from a file instead of prompting.
.TP
.B \-\-password-stdin
Read the master password from standard input.
.TP
.BR \-\-key-file " " \fIFILE\fR
Key file required in addition to the master password.
.TP
.BR \-\-password-env
Allow reading the master password from
.BR $AURAPASS_MASTER_PASSWORD .
.TP
.BR \-\-json
Emit machine-readable JSON where a command supports it.
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Suppress non-essential output.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B init
Create a new vault.
.TP
.B info
Show the header of a vault without unlocking it.
.TP
.B list
List or search items.
.TP
.B show
Print one item in full.
.TP
.B get
Print a single field of an item.
.TP
.B add
Add an item.
.TP
.B edit
Modify an item.
.TP
.B rm
Move an item to the bin, or delete it permanently with
.BR \-\-purge .
.TP
.B restore
Restore an item from the bin.
.TP
.B empty-bin
Permanently delete everything in the bin.
.TP
.B gen
Generate a password, passphrase or PIN.
.TP
.B otp
Print the current one-time password for an item.
.TP
.B audit
Report weak, reused and breached passwords.
.TP
.B import
Add items from another password manager's export.
.TP
.B export
Write a plaintext export or an encrypted backup.
.TP
.B passwd
Change the master password.
.TP
.B categories
List the categories in the vault.
.TP
.B activity
Show the activity log.
.TP
.B bridge
Run the browser bridge in the foreground.
.TP
.B bridge-info
Report the pairing token and the bridge address.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
aurapass init ~/AuraPass/personal.aurapass
aurapass add \-t GitHub \-u alice \-\-generate \-U https://github.com
aurapass get GitHub password | wl-copy
aurapass audit \-\-breach
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/aurapass/config.json
Settings, recent vaults and the browser-bridge pairing token.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AURAPASS_CONFIG_DIR
Override the configuration directory.
.TP
.B AURAPASS_VAULT
Default vault path.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aurapass-desktop (1),
.BR aurapass-bridge (1)
